<Program Use="Target" Name="S01_MagnetFeed" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Generated by JARVIS v1.0.2 (2026-08-19) — SDC State Logic Builder
S01 Magnet_Feed - magnet stack feeder. Clamps the indexed stack (Hold_Down + Top_Retainer), raises the Vertical_Shuttle, drives the Horizontal_Shuttle over with the retainer holding the magnet down, retracts the retainer and confirms Magnet_Present. Presents to Magnet_Pick via p_MagnetReady; retries 3x (MagnetRetryCount) then declares the stack exhausted, unloads and requests the next stack. Partner tags from Dial_Index and Magnet_Pick ship as *Replace placeholders.]]>
</Description>
